<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-CIM half-year net profit up 12.1 pct.</title>
<headline>RTRS-CIM half-year net profit up 12.1 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended Dec 31</p>
<p>	    (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		  8.17 vs  3.85</p>
<p>    Net profit			  6.11 vs  5.45</p>
<p>    Sales				51.14 vs 19.54</p>
<p>    Dividend (cents)		   1.0 vs nil</p>
<p>NOTE: CIM Resources Ltd is a coal miner and its largest shareholder is British coal mining group RJB Mining Plc.</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 373 1800</p>
</text>
